{"ticker":{"symbol":"069730.KS","name":"DSR제강","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":4760.0,"change_pct":-0.06299212598425197,"market_cap":68544000000.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.09033613445378151,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":6150.0,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","country":"South Korea","city":"Suncheon-si","employees":167,"website":"https://www.dsr.com","business_summary":"DSR Wire Corp manufactures wire and wire rope in South Korea. The company provides fiber ropes; music spring wire, drawn steel wire, oil quenched and tempered wire, zinc coated steel wire, stainless steel NF wire, and zinc coated steel wire, as well as offers stainless steel for roping, welding, CHQ, and spring. The company offers its products for crane, mooring/tug, heavy lifting, mining, utility, lesirure/entertainment, commercial fishing, aquaculture, automotive, and general use sectors. The company was formerly known as Chunki Wire Rope Industry Ltd and changed its name to DSR Wire Corp in May 2000. DSR Wire Corp was founded in 1971 and is headquartered in Suncheon-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"DSR Wire Corp는 한국에서 와이어와 와이어로프를 제조합니다. 회사는 섬유 로프를 제공합니다. 뮤직 스프링 와이어, 인발 강선, 오일 담금질 및 템퍼링 와이어, 아연 코팅 강선, 스테인레스 스틸 NF 와이어, 아연 코팅 강선을 비롯하여 로핑, 용접, CHQ, 스프링용 스테인레스 스틸도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 크레인, 계류/예인선, 중량물 들어올리기, 광업, 유틸리티, 레저/오락, 상업용 어업, 양식업, 자동차 및 일반 용도 분야에 제품을 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Chunki Wire Rope Industry Ltd로 알려졌으며 2000년 5월에 DSR Wire Corp로 이름을 변경했습니다. DSR Wire Corp는 1971년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 순천시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"전기장비·부품","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":261687161740.0,"operating_income":26367413770.0,"net_income":28926447510.0,"eps":2009.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":212953620620.0,"operating_income":23494981600.0,"net_income":12943787870.0,"e